        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki likae malaika apuku eing'uaa olperere lo lasar, laa ninye oota naitoreyie enkima. Neipot to ltoilo sapuk ilo oata olalem opi oololo nejoki, “Tudung'ishore olalem lino oololo tasotu nkimarrimarrat oo sabibu te nkop, amu eoto isabibu lenyena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
